GPU clock and power during training (nvidia-smi every 200 ms, 272 busy samples):
SM clock MHz: median 1455  p10 1365  p90 1575      (boost clock ~2460)
power W: median 284  p10 283  p90 285               (power limit 285 W)
temp: median 77 max 83
throttle reasons: 0x4 (SW power cap) 265 samples, none 7
-> the training step runs at the power cap: time ~ energy. Sustained GEMM loops settle near 1140 MHz.

GPU timeline of 2 training steps (torch.profiler, CPU + CUDA):
window 5600.2 ms for 2 steps; GPU busy (any stream) 5569.9 ms (99.5%), idle 30.3 ms

